<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>YelpCamp</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/home.css">
</head>

<body class="d-flex text-center text-white bg-dark">
    <div class="cover-container d-flex w-100 h-100 p-3 mx-auto flex-column">

        <header class="mb-auto">
            <div>
                <h3 class="float-md-start mb-0">YelpCamp</h3>
                <nav class="nav nav-masthead justify-content-center float-md-end">
                    <a class="nav-link active" aria-current="page" href="#">Inicio</a>
                    <a class="nav-link" href="/campgrounds">Campamentos</a>

                    <% if(!currentUser) { %>
                        <a class="nav-link" href="/login">Entrar</a>
                        <a class="nav-link" href="/register">Registrarse</a>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <a class="nav-link" href="/logout">Salir</a>
                            <% } %>
                </nav>
            </div>
        </header>

        <main class="px-3">
            <h1>YelpCamp</h1>
            <p class="lead">Bienvenido a YelpCamp. <br> ¡Salta y explora nuestros campamentos alrededor del mundo o
                comparte el tuyo con la comunidad!</p>
            <p class="lead">
                <a href="/campgrounds" class="btn btn-lg btn-secondary fw-bold border-white bg-white text-dark">Ver
                    Campamentos</a>
            </p>
        </main>

        <footer class="mt-auto text-white-50">
            <p>&copy; 2026 YelpCamp</p>
        </footer>

    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>

</html>